{"id":"CHAI-20260721-081736","symbol":"CHAI","side":"long","trade_date":"2026-07-21","entry_time":"08:17:36","exit_time":"08:18:03","entry_price":0.58,"exit_price":0.5265,"entry_indicator":"No clean entry signal present -- price at $0.58 was excessively extended near the top of the $0.36 - $0.59 range, far above VWAP of $0.52 and EMA9 of $0.49.","exit_indicator":"Price broke down below the actual entry level, hitting $0.5265 as momentum failed and pulled back toward the VWAP of $0.52.","shares":10,"time_in_trade":"00:27","pnl_before_comm":-0.53,"commission":0.12,"pnl_after_comm":-0.65,"win":false,"verdict":"The trader attempted a breakout entry at $0.58, which is right at the top of the display range of $0.36 - $0.59 and severely extended above VWAP of $0.52 and EMA9 of $0.49. Chasing price near the absolute high without a proper pullback to support violates core momentum playbook principles, leaving a tiny margin for error. The trade quickly failed, resulting in a stop-out at $0.5265 as momentum evaporated and price reverted toward VWAP. Entering at such an extended level creates an unfavorable risk-to-reward profile and exposes the trader to immediate downside reversal.","setup_type":"breakout","better_entry":{"price":0.52,"time":"2026-07-21T08:17:00","reason":"Entering at the VWAP level of $0.52 instead of chasing at $0.58 provides a much safer entry with a tighter stop and better risk-to-reward ratio.","how_to_know":"Price pulls back to test the VWAP level at $0.52 during the morning session and begins to curl upward with positive MACD histogram expansion."},"better_exit":{"price":0.68,"time":"2026-07-21T08:20:00","reason":"Exiting at the targeted 2:1 reward level of $0.68 captures the full measured move instead of taking a loss at $0.5265 after chasing an extended high.","how_to_know":"Price reaches the 2:1 reward target at $0.68, calculated from the $0.49 EMA9 stop, while MACD histogram peaks and starts to contract."},"suggested_stop":0.49,"suggested_target":0.68,"risk_reward":"1:2","walk_away_rule":"Walk away from any breakout attempt if price is already extended more than 10% above the VWAP of $0.52.","lessons":[{"lesson":"Avoid chasing breakout entries when price is trading at the extreme high of the range ($0.59) and far above VWAP ($0.52).","how_to_know":"Calculate the percentage distance between current price $0.58 and VWAP $0.52; if greater than 10%, do not chase.","tag":"chased_extension"},{"lesson":"Ensure entries are anchored to key moving averages like the EMA9 at $0.49 or VWAP at $0.52 rather than market-ordering at the highs.","how_to_know":"Check that the entry price is within 2 cents of the EMA9 ($0.49) or VWAP ($0.52) before executing a dip buy.","tag":"late_entry"}],"symbol_info":{"name":"Chai Corporation","country":"United States","sector":"Technology","description":"Chai Corporation develops software and digital platform solutions focused on consumer engagement and mobile transaction services. The company operates within the technology sector, providing cloud-based infrastructure tools for digital businesses."},"indicators":{"avg_volume_30d":8934175.1,"avg_volume_tag":"avgvol_5m_20m","display_price_high":0.589,"display_price_low":0.3603,"ema20_at_entry":0.4708,"ema9_at_entry":0.4891,"entry_price":0.58,"entry_time":"2026-07-21T08:17:36","entry_vs_ema20":"above","entry_vs_ema9":"above","entry_vs_vwap":"above","exit_price":0.5265,"exit_time":"2026-07-21T08:18:03","float_shares":19922402,"float_tag":"float_low_10m_20m","macd_at_entry":0.0162,"macd_hist_at_entry":0.0077,"macd_hist_prior_bar":0.0125,"macd_signal_at_entry":0.0085,"r_multiple":2,"relative_volume":6.144,"reward_per_share":0.2833,"risk_per_share":0.1417,"rvol_tag":"rvol_5x_10x","setup_type":"breakout","stop_price":0.4383,"target_price":0.8633,"volume_on_entry_day":54888651,"vwap_at_entry":0.5207},"bars":[{"c":0.4455,"ema20":0.4455,"ema9":0.4455,"h":0.4455,"l":0.4455,"macd":0,"macd_hist":0,"macd_signal":0,"o":0.4455,"t":"2026-07-21T06:48:00","v":